   </text:sequence-decls>
   <text:p text:style-name="P6">Potenza istantanea<text:span text:style-name="T14"> e potenza media</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3">p(t) = v(t)*i(t) si misura in Watt</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3">v(t) = V<text:span text:style-name="T6">m</text:span> cos(wt+<text:span text:style-name="T1">θ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">v</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">) <text:s text:c="3"/>i(t) = I</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">m </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">cos(wt+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">θ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">i</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:span text:style-name="T11">p(t) = V</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">m</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11"> * I</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">m </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">cos(wt+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">θ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">v</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">)cos(wt+</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">θ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">i</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T11">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P11"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8">cos(A) * cos(B) = 1/2 * [cos(A-B) + cos(A+B)]</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P8"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P1"><text:span text:style-name="T3">=&gt; <text:s text:c="2"/>p(t) = 1/2 V</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">m</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">I</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">m</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> cos(</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">θ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">v</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3"> - </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">θ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">i</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">) + 1/2 V</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">m</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">I</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T7">m </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T3">cos(2wt + </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">θ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T9">v</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1"> + θ</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T9">i</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T1">)</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P11"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">due parti: <text:s/>una tempo indipendente <text:s/>e una tempo dipendente (frequenza doppia 2w rispetto a V e I)</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">durante il ciclo, quando p(t) è positiva la potenza è assorbita dal circuito</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">quando p(t) è negativa la potenza è assorbita dal generatore</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">La potenza media è più utile per le misure</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">E&apos; la <text:s/>media della potenza istantanea in un periodo T</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">P = <text:s/><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Oggetto1" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:y="-0.743cm" svg:width="2.138cm" svg:height="1.198cm" draw:z-index="0"><draw:object>
      <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
