        AQD/AwAAAAAAiAABAAIAAAABAIcAAQAFAAAA/////wCGAAEABAAAAAAAAAByAAIAGgAAAGoH
        AACHAQAAAQAAACkAjwAAAAAAAQABACkAjAABAAAAAACLAAEAAgAAAB8AigABADwAAAADADYA
        AAAKAE9wZW5TeW1ib2wAAAAAAACmAQAA//8AAAAABQAAAAAAAAD/AwAAAAAAAAABAP8DAAAA
        AACIAAEAAgAAAAEAhwABAAUAAAD/////AIYAAQAEAAAAAAAAAHIAAgAaAAAA9gcAAIcBAAAB
        AAAAPQBPAQAAAAABAAEAPQCMAAEAAAAAAIsAAQACAAAAHwCKAAEAQgAAAAMAPAAAABAATGli
        ZXJhdGlvbiBTZXJpZgAAAAAAAKYBAAAAAAAAAAAFAAAAAAAAAP8DAAAAAAAAAAEA/wMAAAAA
        AIgAAQACAAAAAQCHAAEABQAAAP////8AhgABAAQAAAAAAAAAcgACABcAAABFCQAAhwEAAAEA
        MdMAAAAAAAEAAQAxAIwAAQAAAAAAlQABAAQAAAAAAAAAlgABAAIAAAAJAIwAAQAAAAAA
       </office:binary-data>
      </draw:image>
     </draw:frame></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T12"><text:s/>quindi il circuito è puramente resistivo, se la differenza vale +- 90° il circuito è puramente </text:span><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T12">reattivo. Il carico resistivo assorbe potenza per tutto il ciclo temporale, mentre il carico reattivo non assorbe potenza media.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P10"><text:s/></text:p>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
